---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Supporting the SDA Sector - SDA Home Choices" description="While we focus on commercial transactions, SDA Home Choices remains committed to supporting the broader SDA community.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Community"
    title="Supporting the SDA Sector"
  />
  <section class="section"><div class="prose">
    <p>While we focus on commercial transactions, SDA Home Choices remains committed to supporting the broader SDA community. We offer pro bono advisory services to SDA participants and their support networks, providing guidance on navigating the intricacies of SDA housing.</p>
    <p>Additionally, we partner with Supported Independent Living (SIL) providers, offering advice and strategic consultation to board members and executives of both emerging and established organisations.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
